### ──────────────────────────────────
### DERIVED QUERY METHODS
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Productes per categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Fruita
Accept: application/json

### Buscar per nom
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=poma
Accept: application/json

### Rang de preu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/price-range?min=1&max=3
Accept: application/json

### Productes sense stock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/out-of-stock
Accept: application/json

### Comptar per categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/count/Lactis

### Existeix per nom?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/exists-name?name=Poma Golden

### ──────────────────────────────────
### @QUERY JPQL
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Productes per sobre de la mitjana
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/above-average
Accept: application/json

### Top categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/top-categories
Accept: application/json

### Buscar per descripció
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search-desc?keyword=fresc
Accept: application/json

### Categories úniques
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/categories
Accept: application/json

### Productes amb stock baix (llindar: 60)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/low-stock?threshold=60
Accept: application/json

### ──────────────────────────────────
### NATIVE QUERIES
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Producte aleatori
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/random
Accept: application/json

### Top 5 més cars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/top-expensive?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Resum per categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category-summary
Accept: application/json

### ──────────────────────────────────
### @MODIFYING
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Incrementar preus de Begudes en un 5%
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/increase-price?category=Begudes

### Verificar preus de Begudes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Begudes
Accept: application/json

### Resetar stock de tot a 100
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/reset-stock
